MODULE: DrainEventuallyCompletesInfiniteDrainBudget
TARGET: DrainEventuallyCompletes
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: hung storage never consumes the finite shutdown budget
PERTURBS: BudgetTick

--- FIND
    /\ elapsed < DrainBudget /\ elapsed' = elapsed + 1
--- REPLACE
    /\ elapsed < DrainBudget /\ elapsed' = elapsed \* MUTATION: effectively infinite budget.
--- END
